	string "PCIe slot widths (five digits in PCIE#1..5 order)"
	default "11111"
	help
	  Each digit is 1 (x16), 2 (x8x8) or 4 (x4x4x4x4).
	  The S8030 lab bench's NVMe carrier needs 11411.

